{
  "sn45.170:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 45.170 ",
  "sn45.170:0.2": "13. Esanāvagga ",
  "sn45.170:0.3": "Taṇhāsutta ",
  "sn45.170:1.1": "“Tisso imā, bhikkhave, taṇhā. ",
  "sn45.170:1.2": "Katamā tisso? ",
  "sn45.170:1.3": "Kāmataṇhā, bhavataṇhā, vibhavataṇhā—",
  "sn45.170:1.4": "imā kho, bhikkhave, tisso taṇhā. ",
  "sn45.170:1.5": "Imāsaṁ kho, bhikkhave, tissannaṁ taṇhānaṁ abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya …pe… ayaṁ ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo bhāvetabbo. ",
  "sn45.170:1.6": "Katamo ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo? ",
  "sn45.170:1.7": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu sammādiṭṭhiṁ bhāveti vivekanissitaṁ virāganissitaṁ nirodhanissitaṁ vossaggapariṇāmiṁ …pe… sammāsamādhiṁ bhāveti vivekanissitaṁ virāganissitaṁ nirodhanissitaṁ vossaggapariṇāmiṁ. ",
  "sn45.170:1.8": "Imāsaṁ kho, bhikkhave, tissannaṁ taṇhānaṁ abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya …pe… ayaṁ ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo bhāvetabbo”ti. ",
  "sn45.170:1.9": "Dasamaṁ. ",
  "sn45.170:2.0": "Tasināsutta ",
  "sn45.170:2.1": "“Tisso imā, bhikkhave, tasinā. ",
  "sn45.170:2.2": "Katamā tisso? ",
  "sn45.170:2.3": "Kāmatasinā, bhavatasinā, vibhavatasinā. ",
  "sn45.170:2.4": "Imāsaṁ kho, bhikkhave, tissannaṁ tasinānaṁ abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya …pe…. ",
  "sn45.170:2.5": "rāgavinayapariyosānaṁ dosavinayapariyosānaṁ mohavinayapariyosānaṁ …pe… ",
  "sn45.170:2.6": "amato